---
---
<section class="wrap steps-wrap" aria-label="How it works">
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step">
      <div class="art keys-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd class="hot">4</kbd>
      </div>
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <b>Take a screenshot, like always</b>
      <span class="body">Any shortcut, any app. Nothing new to learn.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="receipt sl-thumbscan">
          <span class="r1"></span><span class="r2"></span><span class="r3"></span>
          <span class="total mono"><span>TOTAL</span><span>₹412</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="num">02</span>
      <b>Read on your Mac in a moment</b>
      <span class="body">On-device AI reads the words and what’s on screen. No upload, no wait.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <div class="art pill-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="mini-pill"><span class="mini-dot"></span><span class="mono">Uber receipt – ₹412.png</span><span class="mini-undo">Undo</span></span>
        <span class="tagged">also tagged: receipt</span>
      </div>
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <b>It has a name you’d have chosen</b>
      <span class="body">A quiet pill confirms it. Don’t like it? Undo, or just fix it once and it learns.</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .steps-wrap { padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
  .steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .step { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .step b { font-size: 19px; }
  .num { font: 600 13px var(--mono); color: var(--beam); }
  .body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-2); }
  .art { height: 120px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface-2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
  .keys-art kbd {
    min-width: 44px; height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font: 500 18px var(--keys);
    border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-bottom-width: 3px; background: #1F1F26; color: var(--text);
  }
  .keys-art kbd.hot { border-color: var(--beam); color: var(--beam); }
  .receipt { width: 150px; height: 92px; border-radius: 8px; background: #F4F1EA; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; padding: 12px; }
  .receipt > span:not(.total) { display: block; height: 5px; border-radius: 2px; background: #B9B4A8; }
  .receipt .r1 { width: 50%; height: 8px !important; background: #1E1E24 !important; }
  .receipt .r2 { width: 85%; }
  .receipt .r3 { width: 70%; }
  .total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: auto; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #1E1E24; }
  .pill-art { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 0 8px; }
  .mini-pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 36px; padding: 0 6px 0 10px; max-width: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px; background: #24242C; border: 1px solid #33333C; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .mini-pill .mono { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .mini-dot { flex-shrink: 0; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--beam); }
  .mini-undo { flex-shrink: 0; height: 24px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #33333C; font-size: 11px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .tagged { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .steps-wrap { padding-top: 16px; padding-bottom: 72px; } }
</style>
